pcp_node_count Shows total number of backend nodes.  pcp_node_count -h localhost -U postgres

pcp_node_info Detailed info for a specific node ID.  pcp_node_info -h localhost -U postgres -n 0

pcp_proc_count Shows number of active Pgpool processes.  pcp_proc_count -h localhost -U postgres

pcp_proc_info Status of a specific child process.  pcp_proc_info -h localhost -U postgres -p 0

pcp_pool_status Shows overall pool statistics/config.  pcp_pool_status -h localhost -U postgres

