pcp_watchdog_info Status of HA/Watchdog cluster.  pcp_watchdog_info -h localhost -U postgres

pcp_health_check_stats Shows health check history for a node.  pcp_health_check_stats -h localhost -U postgres -n 0

2. Operational & Management Commands

pcp_reload_config Reloads pgpool.conf without restarting.  pcp_reload_config -h localhost -U postgres

pcp_log_rotate Forces Pgpool to rotate its log files.  pcp_log_rotate -h localhost -U postgres

pcp_invalidate_query_cache Clears the in-memory query cache.  pcp_invalidate_query_cache -h localhost -U postgres

wd_cli Interactive CLI for Watchdog status.  wd_cli -f /etc/pgpool-II/pgpool.conf -v

3. Node Management (Use with caution in production)

pcp_detach_node Take a backend node offline.  pcp_detach_node -h localhost -U postgres -n 1

pcp_attach_node Bring a backend node back online.  pcp_attach_node -h localhost -U postgres -n 1

pcp_promote_node Promote a standby to primary.  pcp_promote_node -h localhost -U postgres -n 1

pcp_recovery_node Start online recovery for a node.  pcp_recovery_node -h localhost -U postgres -n 1

4. Emergency Commands

pcp_stop_pgpool Shuts down the entire Pgpool service.  pcp_stop_pgpool -h localhost -U postgres -m fast
